# D3-TH-005: Equal molar gas amounts need not have equal heat capacity
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
add v1 helium 0.005mol
add v2 N2 0.005mol
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
inspect
heat v1 1J
heat v2 1J
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
inspect
